drafts.tidy:
Crescendo rises on moonlit stage,
My pride above my fate's bright flame;
Titania's eyes, in silver glow,

plays.verse:
Marry, that marry is the very theme I came to talk of!
Ring! I raise my voice;
Schwur und Nacht entwoben, ein Fest!

